{
  "post": {
    "id": "13143678",
    "published": "2017-07-11T03:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "こたえ",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13143678.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20190519101735/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13143678.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは。前回のブログへのコメントありがとうございます(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家好。谢谢大家对上一篇博客的评论(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello. Thank you for the comments on the last blog post(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "無事にカーテンをつけることもできました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "窗帘也顺利装好啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I was able to hang the curtains safely, too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "ufNERdwZ7k.jpg",
            "media": "ed33edae8ae6.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0htZQbGsAiK3VsGwR2d4pUIi5GLRoVeDF9BmM8TxlNIVsZdzx1BGE-QxZFaSwpKxtrFDUadiJgdiYjTSpnVDsyUh1MLBsTWG8lLAUSD0kefU1HKWwkVH9kGxtOfUNFLCkiVy1lERxIcg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ありがとうございます(*´ー｀*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "谢谢你们(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you(*´ー｀*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "✂︎ ---------------------------------------"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■血液型占いを信じるか"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■你相信血型占卜吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Do you believe in blood type fortune-telling?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "占い全般は時と場合により！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "占卜这种东西嘛，得看时机和场合！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fortune-telling in general depends on the time and the occasion! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■革ベルトについてる何か"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■系在皮腰带上的那个东西"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ The thing attached to a leather belt"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "だ、誰か！ベルトに詳しい誰かー！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "谁、谁来！有没有懂皮带的人——！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "S-somebody! Somebody who knows belts, help!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■ポケモンの世界が現実になったら？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■如果宝可梦的世界变成现实？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What if the world of Pokémon became real?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ぎゅってしたい。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "想把它们紧紧抱住。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'd want to hug them tight."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■血液型で相性はきまるか"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■两个人合不合是由血型决定的吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Does blood type decide compatibility?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いいことも悪いことも些細な偶然って重なるので、血液型というより確率の問題なのかな〜て思ってます(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "因为不管是好事还是坏事，都是一些细小的偶然重叠在一起，所以与其说是血型，不如说是概率的问题吧〜我是这么想的(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Good things and bad things are both the result of little coincidences piling up, so I think it's less about blood type and more a matter of probability~ (｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■猛烈になにか食べたくなる原因は？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■突然特别想吃某样东西，原因是什么？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What causes a fierce craving for something to eat?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "なんだろう。においとかかですかねえ？最近はカリカリ梅とシソのおいなりさんにハマってよく食べたくなります。あまじょっぱいの無限おいしすぎ有罪ループの刑おそるべし！！！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "是什么呢。大概是气味之类的吧？最近迷上了脆梅和紫苏做的稻荷寿司，经常特别想吃。那种甜咸交织、好吃到有罪的无限循环之刑，太可怕了！！！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I wonder. Maybe smells? Lately I'm hooked on crunchy pickled plums and shiso inari sushi and often crave them. The sweet-and-salty infinite-deliciousness-is-a-crime loop sentence is terrifying!!! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■歌はなんのためにあるか"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■歌曲是为了什么而存在的？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What is singing for?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "人それぞれ、その時々かもですが、私にとっては「繋がりを感じるためのもの」なのかなあと。共感したいし、共感されたいし、共感されなくてもいいからとにかく言葉にしたいというかなんというか。寂しいから歌ったり歌を聴くのかな。あまり格好いい感情じゃないですね笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "也许因人而异，也因时而异吧。不过对我来说，歌曲或许是“用来感受人与人之间联结的东西”。想与人共鸣，也想被共鸣；就算不被理解也没关系，总之就是想把它化作语言——大概是这种感觉吧。也许正是因为寂寞，才会去唱歌、去听歌吧。这算不上什么帅气的感情呢（笑）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It may differ from person to person and from time to time, but for me I think it's \"a way to feel connected.\" I want to empathize, I want to be empathized with, and even if no one empathizes, I just want to put it into words, or something like that. Maybe I sing and listen to songs because I'm lonely. It's not a very cool feeling, is it lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■買い物で迷う？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■买东西时会犹豫吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Do you hesitate when shopping?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "1500円以上からはかなり迷いに迷って買います…笑 CDと本とぬいぐるみとゲームはすぐに買っちゃうかもです笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "超过1500日元的东西，我会犹豫了又犹豫才买……笑。不过CD、书、毛绒玩具和游戏，可能会马上买下来（笑）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anything over 1,500 yen, I agonize over and agonize over before I buy... lol CDs, books, stuffed animals and games I might buy right away lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■作曲に挑戦したことは？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■挑战过作曲吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Have you ever tried composing?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今またまさに。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "现在正好在做。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Right now, as a matter of fact."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■はやく走るには？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■怎样跑才能更快？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ How can I run fast?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "陸上選手の方はみなさん走っている姿がとてもきれいなのでフォームですかね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "田径选手们跑起来的姿势都很好看，所以大概是跑步姿势的问题吧。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Track athletes all look so beautiful when they run, so I'd say it's the form."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■歌をはじめたきっかけは？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■开始唱歌的契机是什么？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What got you started in singing?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "演奏してみた動画などをみて動画投稿に興味をもったからです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "因为看了“试着演奏”之类的视频，对投稿视频产生了兴趣。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It was because I got interested in posting videos after watching \"I tried playing it\" videos and the like."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■洗濯バサミがたくさんついた物の製品名は？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■那种夹着很多晾衣夹的东西，产品名叫什么？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What's the product name of that thing with lots of clothespins attached?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "パラソルハンガーって言ってましたが正式はどうなんだろう汗"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我一直管它叫“伞形晾衣架”，不过正式名称到底是什么呢（汗）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I heard it called a \"parasol hanger,\" but I wonder what the official name is, sweat"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■炒飯最後まできれいに食べるの難しい問題"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■把炒饭干干净净吃到最后一粒的这个难题"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ The problem of finishing fried rice cleanly to the very last grain"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "食べきりたいという強いハートです(｀・ω・´)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "靠的是一颗“一定要全部吃完”的坚强的心(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It takes a strong heart that wants to finish it all(｀・ω・´)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■ごはんの前にお菓子食べたいの治したい！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■想改掉“饭前想吃零食”的毛病！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ I want to stop wanting to eat sweets before a meal!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "意志の強いハートをもつのです(｀・ω・´)なお私は負けます。KO。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "要拥有一颗意志坚强的心(｀・ω・´)。不过，我是会输的。被KO。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You need a strong-willed heart(｀・ω・´) For the record, I lose. KO."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■素麺の飽きない食べ方"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■百吃不腻的素面吃法"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ A way to eat somen noodles without getting bored"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "サラダをトッピング、ラーメン風にしてみるなどおすすめです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "推荐试试把沙拉加在上面当配料，或者做成拉面风味之类的吃法。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I recommend topping them with salad or making them ramen-style."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■七夕に願いごとかきました？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■七夕，你写愿望了吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Did you write a wish for Tanabata?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ツイッター短冊に書きました！笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "写在推特的许愿签上了！笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I wrote it on a Twitter wish strip! lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■ノンシリコンとシリコン、どっちが頭にいい？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■无硅油和含硅油，哪个对头发更好？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Which is better for your head, non-silicone or silicone?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "イメージ的にはノンシリコンなのかなと？どうなんだろう〜〜考えたこともありませんでした。気になる！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "凭印象的话，是不是无硅油比较好呢？到底怎么样呢～～我还从没想过这个问题。好在意！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My image is that it's non-silicone? I wonder how it really is~~ I'd never thought about it. Now I'm curious!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■夏に外にでたくなる方法"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■想让自己愿意在夏天出门的方法"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ How to make yourself want to go outside in summer"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "恋をするのです(｀・ω・´)キリッ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "去谈个恋爱吧(｀・ω・´)认真！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Fall in love(｀・ω・´) Ahem."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■最近よく聴く曲、歌手は？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■最近经常听的歌和歌手是？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ What songs and singers have you been listening to lately?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "目覚ましに設定されている「月曜9時のおままごと」を毎朝狂ったように何度も…笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "每天早上都会像疯了一样，把设成闹钟的《周一9点的过家家》反反复复听好多遍……笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My alarm is set to \"Getsuyou 9-ji no Omamagoto\" (Monday 9 o'clock Playing House), and I listen to it over and over like crazy every morning... lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■宇宙に端はある？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■宇宙有尽头吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Does space have an edge?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ないほうがいいな〜〜でもあるならどんな風か気になるな〜〜とどちらでも宇宙にはロマンがありますね！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "希望没有尽头呢～～不过如果真有的话，又很在意它会是什么样子～～不管哪种，宇宙都充满浪漫呢！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'd rather it didn't~~ but if it does, I'm curious what it's like~~ so either way, space is full of romance!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "■鹿角って地名知ってる？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■你知道“鹿角”这个地名吗？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "■ Do you know a place called Kazuno?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "実は名前だけ知ってました！鹿って漢字が目についちゃう病気です笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "其实我只知道这个名字！我得了看到“鹿”这个汉字就会不由自主注意到的病（笑）"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Actually, I only knew the name! I have a condition where the kanji for deer jumps out at me lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "以上、突発的な七夕企画でした(=´∀｀)🌠"
